{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 203,
  "number": "0203",
  "title": "Daily Life - Calling Tech Support",
  "audio": "mp3/203. Daily Life - Calling Tech Support.mp3",
  "duration": 702.5633125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.44,
      "en": "Hello everyone and welcome to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "大家好，欢迎来到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.82,
      "end": 6.3,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.76,
      "end": 11.22,
      "en": "My name is Catherine and today we have an elementary level lesson for you all about computers.",
      "zh": "我的名字是凯瑟琳，今天我们为大家准备了一个关于计算机的初级课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 12.68,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.06,
      "end": 23.28,
      "en": "So we are going to take a look at some of the basic parts of a computer and also about bad programs that could affect your computer and make it not work.",
      "zh": "因此，我们将看看计算机的一些基本部分以及可能影响您的计算机并使其无法工作的错误程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 23.68,
      "end": 24.16,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 24.42,
      "end": 30.64,
      "en": "So before we get going, we have a verb for you that we're going to look at in vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "所以在我们开始之前，我们有一个动词给你，我们将在词汇预览中查看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 33.12,
      "end": 33.6,
      "en": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 34.12,
      "end": 35.12,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 35.12,
      "end": 40.6,
      "en": "So today on vocabulary preview, we have a verb as you said, and it's to crash.",
      "zh": "所以今天在词汇预览中，我们有一个你所说的动词，它是崩溃的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 41.4,
      "end": 41.72,
      "en": "To crash.",
      "zh": "崩溃。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 42.56,
      "end": 42.98,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 51.94,
      "en": "This has a couple of different meanings, but in today's dialogue, this means for your computer to shut down or to freeze or to stop working.",
      "zh": "这有几个不同的含义，但在今天的对话中，这意味着您的计算机关闭或冻结或停止工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 52.28,
      "end": 52.48,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 52.6,
      "end": 55.32,
      "en": "because maybe you heard of a car crash, right?",
      "zh": "因为也许你听说过车祸，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 55.52,
      "end": 57.72,
      "en": "When two cars, bam, hit each other.",
      "zh": "当两辆汽车，BAM 互相撞击时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 57.72,
      "end": 60.96,
      "en": "In this case, your computer is just not working anymore.",
      "zh": "在这种情况下，您的计算机不再工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 61.16,
      "end": 62.44,
      "en": "It stopped working.",
      "zh": "它停止了工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 62.44,
      "end": 62.92,
      "en": "It freezes.",
      "zh": "它冻结了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 63.92,
      "end": 64.24,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 65.3,
      "en": "So you can't use it.",
      "zh": "所以你不能使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 65.7,
      "end": 69.7,
      "en": "So my computer crashed is a way to say my computer stopped working.",
      "zh": "所以我的电脑崩溃是说我的电脑停止工作的一种方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 70.58,
      "end": 70.94,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 71.52,
      "end": 74.02,
      "en": "So that's a word that we're going to listen in our dialogue today.",
      "zh": "所以这是我们今天要在对话中倾听的一个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 74.28,
      "end": 77.12,
      "en": "Why don't we jump right into it and we'll be back shortly.",
      "zh": "我们为什么不直接跳进去，我们很快就会回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 82.9,
      "end": 83.28,
      "en": "Hello.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 84.12,
      "end": 85.72,
      "en": "Thanks for calling one, two, three tech help.",
      "zh": "感谢您致电“123 技术支持”。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 85.78,
      "end": 86.0,
      "en": "I'm Todd.",
      "zh": "我叫托德。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 86.4,
      "end": 87.02,
      "en": "How can I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 87.72,
      "end": 87.98,
      "en": "Hello.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 88.74,
      "end": 90.21,
      "en": "Can you help me on my computer?",
      "zh": "你能在我的电脑上帮我吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 91.15,
      "end": 91.59,
      "en": "Oh man.",
      "zh": "天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 91.95,
      "end": 92.63,
      "en": "It's okay, sir.",
      "zh": "没事的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 93.05,
      "end": 93.55,
      "en": "Calm down.",
      "zh": "冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 93.91,
      "end": 94.29,
      "en": "What happened?",
      "zh": "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 94.73,
      "end": 96.39,
      "en": "I turned on my laptop and it broke.",
      "zh": "我打开了我的笔记本电脑，它坏了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 97.31,
      "end": 98.59,
      "en": "I mean, the monitor went black.",
      "zh": "我的意思是，显示器变黑了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 99.09,
      "end": 99.77,
      "en": "Okay, sir.",
      "zh": "好的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 100.09,
      "end": 101.81,
      "en": "It sounds like you might have a virus.",
      "zh": "听起来你可能感染了病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 102.65,
      "end": 103.75,
      "en": "I don't feel sick.",
      "zh": "我没觉得不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 104.63,
      "end": 105.03,
      "en": "Let me check.",
      "zh": "让我检查一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 105.78,
      "end": 106.3,
      "en": "Nope.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 106.46,
      "end": 106.94,
      "en": "No fever.",
      "zh": "没发烧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 107.48,
      "end": 108.48,
      "en": "I'm fine.",
      "zh": "我很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 108.48,
      "end": 110.52,
      "en": "No, your computer might have a virus.",
      "zh": "不，您的计算机可能有病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 111.1,
      "end": 113.54,
      "en": "I mean, it has a bad program on it.",
      "zh": "我是说，电脑里有恶意程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 113.98,
      "end": 115.08,
      "en": "Maybe that's why it crashed.",
      "zh": "也许这就是它崩溃的原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 115.84,
      "end": 122.16,
      "en": "I recommend that you run an antivirus program in order to safely remove any unwanted spyware or trojans.",
      "zh": "我建议您运行防病毒程序以安全地删除任何不需要的间谍软件或木马。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 122.16,
      "end": 123.16,
      "en": "Phew.",
      "zh": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 123.16,
      "end": 124.16,
      "en": "Wait a minute.",
      "zh": "等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 124.16,
      "end": 125.16,
      "en": "Crash, spyware, trojans.",
      "zh": "崩溃，间谍软件，特洛伊木马。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 125.16,
      "end": 126.16,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 126.16,
      "end": 127.16,
      "en": "Where?",
      "zh": "在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 127.16,
      "end": 128.16,
      "en": "When?",
      "zh": "什么时候？"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 128.16,
      "end": 129.16,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 135.81,
      "end": 138.49,
      "en": "So lots of great technology words today.",
      "zh": "今天有很多很棒的技术词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 138.73,
      "end": 141.51,
      "en": "Let's take a look at a few of them in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "让我们来看看他们中的一些语言外卖。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 144.02,
      "end": 145.34,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 145.64,
      "end": 147.08,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 147.08,
      "end": 149.63,
      "en": "So let's start off with our first word.",
      "zh": "所以让我们从我们的第一个词开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 150.24,
      "end": 153.43,
      "en": "You've probably heard it before, but let's go over it just in case.",
      "zh": "你可能以前听过，但让我们来看看它以防万一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 154.17,
      "end": 154.75,
      "en": "A laptop.",
      "zh": "笔记本电脑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 155.45,
      "end": 156.04,
      "en": "Laptop.",
      "zh": "笔记本。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 156.04,
      "end": 158.69,
      "en": "A laptop is a kind of computer.",
      "zh": "笔记本电脑是一种计算机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 159.46,
      "end": 161.04,
      "en": "We have desktop, laptop.",
      "zh": "我们有台式机，笔记本电脑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 161.23,
      "end": 161.45,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 162.04,
      "end": 164.56,
      "en": "So your lap is the top part of your legs.",
      "zh": "所以你的腿是你腿的顶部。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 164.56,
      "end": 170.15,
      "en": "So a laptop computer is a small portable computer that you can take with you anywhere.",
      "zh": "因此，笔记本电脑是一台小型便携式计算机，您可以随身携带。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 170.55,
      "end": 170.87,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 171.72,
      "end": 175.0,
      "en": "A lot of students have laptops and businessmen as well.",
      "zh": "很多学生也有笔记本电脑和商人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 175.0,
      "end": 177.01,
      "en": "So you mentioned the opposite would be a desktop.",
      "zh": "所以你提到相反的将是一个桌面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 177.63,
      "end": 177.79,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 177.99,
      "end": 179.55,
      "en": "So it sits on top of a desk.",
      "zh": "所以它坐在桌子上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 179.87,
      "end": 180.15,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 180.63,
      "end": 186.51,
      "en": "So both a desktop and a laptop have monitors, a computer monitor.",
      "zh": "所以台式机和笔记本电脑都有显示器，电脑显示器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 187.05,
      "end": 190.15,
      "en": "So a monitor is like a TV for your computer.",
      "zh": "所以显示器就像你的电脑的电视。"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 190.69,
      "end": 192.65,
      "en": "It's where you can see what you're doing.",
      "zh": "在这里你可以看到你在做什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 192.93,
      "end": 193.25,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 193.59,
      "end": 196.75,
      "en": "So it's called a monitor or a screen maybe.",
      "zh": "所以它可能被称为显示器或屏幕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 197.64,
      "end": 207.64,
      "en": "You can also use the word screen, but monitor is the technical word for the, usually a box, like a TV that goes with the desktop computer.",
      "zh": "您也可以使用单词屏幕，但显示器是技术字，通常是一个盒子，就像与台式电脑一起使用的电视。"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 208.08,
      "end": 208.22,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 209.08,
      "end": 210.08,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 210.08,
      "end": 215.37,
      "en": "So Todd, the computer guy said, Hey, I think your computer might have a virus.",
      "zh": "所以托德，电脑人说，嘿，我想你的电脑可能有病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 215.85,
      "end": 217.23,
      "en": "Ooh, that doesn't sound good.",
      "zh": "哦，这听起来不太好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 217.57,
      "end": 217.71,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 217.95,
      "end": 218.41,
      "en": "A virus.",
      "zh": "一种病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 219.56,
      "end": 222.36,
      "en": "So I guess you know what a virus is when you get sick, right?",
      "zh": "所以我猜你生病时知道什么是病毒，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 222.36,
      "end": 223.75,
      "en": "You get the flu or the cold.",
      "zh": "你得了流感或感冒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 223.97,
      "end": 224.21,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 224.33,
      "end": 229.55,
      "en": "You can say I have a virus, but how can a computer have a virus?",
      "zh": "你可以说我有病毒，但电脑怎么会感染病毒？"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 229.79,
      "end": 234.34,
      "en": "This means it's a program that is designed to hurt your computer.",
      "zh": "这意味着它是一个旨在伤害您的计算机的程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 234.44,
      "end": 235.44,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "start": 235.44,
      "end": 237.48,
      "en": "So it's like your computer is sick and it doesn't work.",
      "zh": "所以就像你的电脑生病了，它不工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 237.74,
      "end": 240.9,
      "en": "So a virus might make your computer crash.",
      "zh": "因此，病毒可能会使您的计算机崩溃。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 241.38,
      "end": 241.74,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 242.14,
      "end": 246.84,
      "en": "So in order to avoid this, what we need is an antivirus program.",
      "zh": "所以为了避免这种情况，我们需要的是一个防病毒程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 247.34,
      "end": 247.66,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 247.7,
      "end": 249.58,
      "en": "So virus is a bad thing.",
      "zh": "所以病毒是一件坏事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 250.18,
      "end": 251.56,
      "en": "Antivirus is a good thing.",
      "zh": "防病毒是个好东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 251.78,
      "end": 256.98,
      "en": "An antivirus program is a program that protects your computer from viruses.",
      "zh": "防病毒程序是保护您的计算机免受病毒侵害的程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 257.98,
      "end": 259.54,
      "en": "So you would say antivirus.",
      "zh": "所以你会说防病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 260.32,
      "end": 267.0,
      "en": "You might've heard of a very famous program called Norton antivirus or McAfee antivirus.",
      "zh": "您可能听说过一个非常著名的程序，称为 Norton Antivirus 或 McAfee Antivirus。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 267.16,
      "end": 268.02,
      "en": "These are brands.",
      "zh": "这些是品牌。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 268.16,
      "end": 269.16,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 269.44,
      "end": 269.88,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 270.58,
      "end": 274.14,
      "en": "So those are some of the main technical terms that we have on Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "所以这些是我们在语言外卖方面的一些主要技术术语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 275.0,
      "end": 277.14,
      "en": "Why don't we listen to our dialogue quickly once again.",
      "zh": "我们为什么不再次快速聆听我们的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 277.92,
      "end": 282.0,
      "en": "Why don't we listen to our dialogue quickly again and we'll be back with Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "我们为什么不快速听我们的对话，我们会带着 Flueny Builder 回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 283.32,
      "end": 284.84,
      "en": "Hello.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 284.84,
      "end": 289.16,
      "en": "Thanks for calling 123 Tech Help.",
