      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 507.25,
      "end": 509.21,
      "en": "So it's a way to offer an explanation.",
      "zh": "所以这是一种提供解释的方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 509.24,
      "end": 510.92,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 510.92,
      "end": 512.83,
      "en": "So try and use that one in your speech this week.",
      "zh": "所以试着在你本周的演讲中使用那个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 513.56,
      "end": 516.47,
      "en": "It's really, really great common English phrase.",
      "zh": "这是一个非常非常好的普通英语短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 516.92,
      "end": 517.92,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 517.92,
      "end": 522.33,
      "en": "So why don't we listen to our dialogue for the last time and we'll be back to talk a little bit more.",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不最后一次听我们的对话，我们会回来多说一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 524.76,
      "end": 527.04,
      "en": "Hello.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 529.37,
      "end": 531.09,
      "en": "Thanks for calling 123 tech help.",
      "zh": "感谢您致电 123 技术帮助。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 531.41,
      "end": 531.67,
      "en": "I'm Todd.",
      "zh": "我叫托德。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 532.07,
      "end": 532.69,
      "en": "How can I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 533.4,
      "end": 534.4,
      "en": "Hello.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 534.4,
      "end": 535.85,
      "en": "Can you help me on my computer?",
      "zh": "你能在我的电脑上帮我吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 536.83,
      "end": 537.29,
      "en": "Oh man.",
      "zh": "天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 537.65,
      "end": 538.29,
      "en": "It's okay, sir.",
      "zh": "没事的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 538.73,
      "end": 539.25,
      "en": "Calm down.",
      "zh": "冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 539.53,
      "end": 539.93,
      "en": "What happened?",
      "zh": "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 540.8,
      "end": 542.6,
      "en": "I turned on my laptop and it broke.",
      "zh": "我打开了我的笔记本电脑，它坏了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 543.01,
      "end": 544.29,
      "en": "I mean, the monitor went black.",
      "zh": "我的意思是，显示器变黑了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 544.77,
      "end": 545.45,
      "en": "Okay, sir.",
      "zh": "好的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 545.75,
      "end": 547.51,
      "en": "It sounds like you might have a virus.",
      "zh": "听起来你可能感染了病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 548.29,
      "end": 549.4,
      "en": "I don't feel sick.",
      "zh": "我没觉得不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 549.4,
      "end": 550.4,
      "en": "Let me check.",
      "zh": "让我检查一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 550.4,
      "end": 551.4,
      "en": "Nope.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 552.14,
      "end": 552.4,
      "en": "No fever.",
      "zh": "没发烧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 552.4,
      "end": 553.4,
      "en": "I'm fine.",
      "zh": "我很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 553.54,
      "end": 556.2,
      "en": "No, your computer might have a virus.",
      "zh": "不，您的计算机可能有病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 556.74,
      "end": 559.22,
      "en": "I mean, it has a bad program on it.",
      "zh": "我是说，电脑里有恶意程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 559.6,
      "end": 560.74,
      "en": "Maybe that's why it crashed.",
      "zh": "也许这就是它崩溃的原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 561.58,
      "end": 567.58,
      "en": "I recommend that you run an antivirus program in order to safely remove any unwanted spyware or Trojans.",
      "zh": "我建议您运行防病毒程序以安全地删除任何不需要的间谍软件或木马。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 568.4,
      "end": 569.96,
      "en": "Phew.",
      "zh": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 569.96,
      "end": 570.96,
      "en": "Wait a minute.",
      "zh": "等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 571.0,
      "end": 571.26,
      "en": "Crash?",
      "zh": "崩溃？"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 572.24,
      "end": 572.74,
      "en": "Spyware?",
      "zh": "间谍软件？"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 573.52,
      "end": 573.92,
      "en": "Trojans?",
      "zh": "特洛伊木马？"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 573.96,
      "end": 574.96,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 574.96,
      "end": 575.96,
      "en": "Where?",
      "zh": "在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 575.96,
      "end": 576.96,
      "en": "When?",
      "zh": "什么时候？"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 576.96,
      "end": 577.96,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 583.86,
      "end": 588.9,
      "en": "So Marco, in today's dialogue, we heard a couple of strange words about computer viruses.",
      "zh": "所以马可，在今天的对话中，我们听到了一些关于计算机病毒的奇怪词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 589.54,
      "end": 594.72,
      "en": "One of them you might be familiar with from Greek stories and fables.",
      "zh": "您可能熟悉希腊故事和寓言的其中之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 595.46,
      "end": 595.96,
      "en": "A Trojan.",
      "zh": "特洛伊木马。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 595.96,
      "end": 596.96,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 596.96,
      "end": 597.96,
      "en": "A Trojan.",
      "zh": "特洛伊木马。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 597.96,
      "end": 602.14,
      "en": "So it's a kind of bad software that will hurt your computer.",
      "zh": "所以这是一种会伤害你的电脑的坏软件。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 602.4,
      "end": 610.34,
      "en": "Yeah, it's a type of virus that comes in and it's supposed to be a good program or not harm your computer, but it's really just a lie.",
      "zh": "是的，它是一种病毒，它应该是一个好的程序或不会伤害您的计算机，但它实际上只是一个谎言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 610.6,
      "end": 614.48,
      "en": "It's disguised as something else and then it starts to really ruin your computer.",
      "zh": "它伪装成别的东西，然后它开始真正毁了你的电脑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 614.7,
      "end": 615.64,
      "en": "They're very, very dangerous.",
      "zh": "它们非常非常危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 615.88,
      "end": 616.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 616.88,
      "end": 618.34,
      "en": "So why do you think it's called a Trojan?",
      "zh": "那么你为什么认为它被称为特洛伊木马呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 618.58,
      "end": 619.08,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 619.4,
      "end": 624.58,
      "en": "Probably because of a Troy something, because it's very difficult like a Trojan.",
      "zh": "可能是因为特洛伊的东西，因为它像特洛伊木马一样非常困难。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 625.1,
      "end": 628.16,
      "en": "Well, think about the story of the Trojan horse, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，想想特洛伊木马的故事，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 628.4,
      "end": 629.4,
      "en": "You know that story.",
      "zh": "你知道那个故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 629.4,
      "end": 637.72,
      "en": "So back in ancient Greece, there was a war happening and Troy wanted to defeat its enemy and they didn't know how to do it.",
      "zh": "所以回到古希腊，发生了一场战争，特洛伊想打败它的敌人，他们不知道该怎么做。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 637.72,
      "end": 641.16,
      "en": "So they thought and thought and thought and they came up with an idea.",
      "zh": "所以他们思考、思考和思考，他们想出了一个想法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 641.8,
      "end": 647.46,
      "en": "They would build a horse and they would give it as a gift, but inside the horse would be warriors, fighters.",
      "zh": "他们会建造一匹马，他们会把它作为礼物送给，但在马的内部将是战士、战士。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 648.44,
      "end": 656.44,
      "en": "So when the city opened its doors to this wonderful gift, they would receive a horrible gift and attack.",
      "zh": "因此，当这座城市向这份美妙的礼物敞开大门时，他们会收到一份可怕的礼物和攻击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 656.44,
      "end": 657.96,
      "en": "And so Trojan is like that.",
      "zh": "所以特洛伊木马就是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 657.96,
      "end": 662.32,
      "en": "It's like software that you think is safe, but then it attacks your computer by surprise.",
      "zh": "这就像您认为安全的软件，但它会突然攻击您的计算机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 663.18,
      "end": 663.7,
      "en": "They're very dangerous.",
      "zh": "它们非常危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 664.18,
      "end": 669.76,
      "en": "And now things have come up like Trojans and worms and a lot of different names for them.",
      "zh": "现在事情已经出现了，比如木马和蠕虫，还有很多不同的名字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 669.76,
      "end": 674.02,
      "en": "But it's crazy now, although I hear Mac users don't have these problems.",
      "zh": "但现在很疯狂，尽管我听说 Mac 用户没有这些问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 674.38,
      "end": 675.0,
      "en": "We do not.",
      "zh": "我们没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 675.46,
      "end": 682.17,
      "en": "If you use a Macintosh computer, you probably have very few problems with viruses and things like that.",
      "zh": "如果您使用 Macintosh 计算机，您可能几乎没有病毒之类的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 682.84,
      "end": 683.84,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 683.84,
      "end": 685.03,
      "en": "That's one point in favor for Mac users.",
      "zh": "这对 Mac 用户有利之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 685.44,
      "end": 686.44,
      "en": "Absolutely.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 686.44,
      "end": 686.57,
      "en": "So let us know.",
      "zh": "所以，请告诉我们吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 687.44,
      "end": 688.95,
      "en": "Have you had problems with a virus on your computer?",
      "zh": "您的计算机上是否有病毒问题？"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 689.71,
      "end": 690.65,
      "en": "Have you ever called tech support?",
      "zh": "你有没有打电话给技术支持？"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 691.0,
      "end": 692.84,
      "en": "Our website is EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "我们的网站是 EnglishPod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 692.85,
      "end": 693.51,
      "en": "We hope to see you there.",
      "zh": "希望到时候见到你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 693.84,
      "end": 693.97,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 694.84,
      "end": 695.84,
      "en": "Bye, everyone.",
      "zh": "大家再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 695.84,
      "end": 702.563,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
